mindmap
  root((Continuous Compliance Codebase))
    UI (Vue 3 + Vite + Pinia + PrimeVue)
      HTTP Layer
        Axios instances (auth, guest)
        useDataApi/useGuestApi
        Transforms (decamelize out, camelcase in)
      Authentication
        Login form (cookie-based)
        SSO providers and initiate
      Catalogs Feature
        Catalog list/view/create/edit/delete
        Group/Control modals and part edits
        Shared delete composable (useCatalogDelete)
      Other Features
        SSP, Assessments, Evidence, Profiles, Components
    API (Go + Echo + GORM + Postgres)
      Configuration
        DB, JWT, CORS, WebBaseURL
        SSO and Email configs
      Authentication
        /auth/login (JWT cookie)
        /auth/token (OAuth2 password)
        SSO providers/initiate/callback
      OSCAL Catalogs
        Catalogs/Groups/Controls CRUD
        Cascade delete implementation
        Root groups query and traversal
      Relational Models
        User (bcrypt, last login)
        OSCAL entities (SSP, assessments, POAM, profiles)
      Metrics
        Prometheus counters/instrumentation
      Testing
        Integration tests (Echo + Postgres container)
        SDK integration suite (client/server)
